/ Compact map showing the event location + student's current position.
/ Browser geolocation consent prompt fires on "Use my current location";
/ on denial, inline error + explicit Retry button. No manual-coord bypass
/ (would defeat the geofence security beat the API will enforce next week).
/ Init code: assets/js/attendance_map.js reads the data-* attributes below
/ (inline scripts and style= attributes are blocked by the CSP).

div id="attendance-map-#{event.id}" class="map-canvas-sm rounded border mb-2" data-attendance-map="" data-event-id=event.id data-lat=event.location.latitude.to_f data-lon=event.location.longitude.to_f
div id="attendance-map-error-#{event.id}" class="text-danger small d-none"
  span class="me-2"
  button type='button' class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary attendance-retry-btn" data-event-id=event.id
    | Retry
